usage: zc build <src> [flags]
Compile <src> to a native executable.
Output goes to -o OUT, else <unit> (<unit>.exe for windows targets) in the
project's directory (project.zd's outputDir moves it), or outside a project in .
Flags: --src DIR (may repeat) --system DIR --release
       --cc CC --cc-mode spawn|inproc --tcc-lib DIR --target TRIPLE
       --cflags STR --ldflags STR --save-temps --time
       --fast-hash --readable-names --eager
       --nativec-files --mark-natives --line-marks
